<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net seller of Japan stocks via 12 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net seller of Japan stocks via 12 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 12 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Thursday showed a net selling stance of 9.8 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor buy orders totalled 15.10 million shares while sell orders amounted to 24.90 million shares.</p>
</text>
